## Setup

```bash
mise trust && mise install
uv sync --all-groups
```

With mise activated, `task` and `uv` are on your `PATH`. After `uv sync`, project tools live in `.venv`.

## Tasks

Root `task --list` stays short (CI-facing). More targets live under `ci/` and `docs/`.

```bash
task               # list root tasks (one entry per topic)
task test          # full CI gate (core + docs)
task test_core     # unit + coverage + lint (no docs)
task fix_lint      # auto-fix formatters
task docs          # serve docs (Zensical)

cd docs && task    # full docs menu (serve, build, publish, …)
cd ci && task      # full CI menu (lint slices, unit, coverage, …)
```

## Docs

[Zensical](https://zensical.org/) site under `docs/` (config: `docs/mkdocs.yml`). Shortcut: `task docs`.

## Release

```bash
./scripts/release.sh patch   # bump, commit, tag
git push && git push --tags
```
